          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.39+LEV.25.40+LEV.25.41+LEV.25.42+LEV.25.43+LEV.25.44+LEV.25.45+LEV.25.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 25:39-46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kïkany ato kyolwokwa werïngwo nyo pö Israel, nyo le ngetat anta korka akïpöghisyewokwa könyis mut nko akonga, atyak nyinte könyito mut nko odeny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwotini kangeta nyinte korenkwa, makany kïwö kwïle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otöninekwa nyinte ompö köromnyö: kechir nko pagh nko dipay,* kïrïp kegh nko wölini kesoyöntokwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anan lö kyochikwa sekey ompö koro Misri. Kïsörunenokwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa. Wöloni, nka nyï omwowokwa asisete lö arïpa ngalechan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wölo ato lenchï chi sekeyontenyi, ‘Moweghonanye korengu,’ ompöwölo chöminyi nyinte nko katangu, akïngarakate nyinte ato mi nko nyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icheng kata airïtö yitïnyi kïnam ket pö kukat atökïlïkwï sekeyontengu kokay. Aigh lenyoni tïkwïl ompö työ nyo le sekeyontengu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amekany kwaghïghit ompö nyi, pïstenö kïweghö katangu, ompöwölo kökakïpöghisyewunyi nyinte könyis mut nko akonga ighisyö nyo köpö mötwor odeny. Atö kusoyönïn ECHOTYON Tororötïngu ompö tïkwïn löwïr cho ighenyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Twatanpa tïch nko kechir",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuw 13:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Itïlilchï ECHOTYON Tororötïngu twatanpa tïch nko cho pö kechir cho melö sökote, mepöghisyeghö tïch cho le twatan ompö ighisyö anka tïkwïl amemut puto kechiryechoni le twatan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omenyi nyinte nko piko kongu ompö köny anka tïkwïl ompö tawu ECHOTYON Tororötïngu ompö wölini kakïl kesagha nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo meropchï ECHOTYON Tororötïngu kïgh nyo sapul nyo melö tenate nyo ngwolöy anta nyo karote anta nyo le sölwö le amöros. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokwa panyekwa kestonikwo akwa löwïr, ato kochï tïlilöch anta kochï orusöch, kïle wölini omekwa cheptirkich anta asarïch. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
